PLACEHOLDER - THIS IS A DECISION THE PROJECT OWNER STILL NEEDS TO MAKE.

No licence has been chosen yet. Until one is, no permission is granted to use,
copy, modify or distribute this software.

A deliberately restrictive placeholder was chosen because this project is
intended to possibly become a commercial product, and because the backend may
later be split into a private repository. Applying a permissive open-source
licence (MIT, Apache-2.0) is effectively irreversible for any version already
published under it, so that choice should be made explicitly rather than by
default.

Note that this licence governs only this project's own source code. It does not
and cannot grant any rights over data obtained from third-party providers,
whose terms apply independently.
